  "instructions": [
    "Heat the vegetable broth in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the mung bean dum and cook until slightly browned, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the smoked paprika, Thai chili peppers, and fish sauce. Stir to combine.",
    "Add the vermicelli pasta and cook, stirring constantly, for 2-3 minutes or until slightly wilted.",
    "Pour in the coconut milk and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook, stirring occasionally, for 2-3 minutes or until heated through.",
    "Stir in the lime juice, brown sugar, and fresh cilantro.",
    "Wrap each portion in a ti-leaf wrap and serve hot.",
    "Garnish with additional fresh cilantro, if desired.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
  ],
